stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NoSubscription

    NoSubscription --> Checkout: User selects plan
    Checkout --> Active: Payment successful
    Checkout --> NoSubscription: Payment cancelled

    Active --> PendingCancellation: User cancels
    Active --> PlanChangeScheduled: Upgrade / Downgrade
    Active --> Active: Billing period renews

    PendingCancellation --> Expired: Period ends
    PendingCancellation --> Active: User resumes

    PlanChangeScheduled --> Active: Change applied

    Expired --> Checkout: User resubscribes
    Expired --> [*]
